SUMMARY:Midsummer Night Sings
DESCRIPTION:Spend your summer singing with Sonoma Bach!\nWe invite singers of all levels to gather for three joyful evenings of choral music-making. Each session offers the chance to dive into fantastic choral music in a welcoming\, no-pressure environment. Just bring your voice and your enthusiasm! Whether you’re a longtime chorister or simply love to sing\, join us for music\, community\, and the magic of midsummer evenings shared in song. \nPenngrove Clubhouse\n385 Woodward Ave.\, Penngrove\n$15 per session | $40 for all 3 \nJuly 15 – Bob Worth: Highlights from Bach’s Mass in B Minor\nJuly 22 – Amanda McFadden: American Spirituals\nJuly 29 – Magen Solomon: Bach’s Mass in G\, Jesu meine Freude & Cantata 131 \nAll scores provided!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/midsummer-night-sings-3/
LOCATION:penngrove clubhouse\, 385 Woodward Ave.\, Penngrove\, 94951
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
